<title>CHINA: China Jan-Aug tin output down 5.91 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>China Jan-Aug tin output down 5.91 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's tin output totalled 35,504 tonnes in the first eight months of 1996, falling by 5.91 percent compared with the same period last year, the State Statistical Bureau said on Monday.</p>
<p>Tin production in August was 5,045 tonnes, the bureau said.</p>
</text>
